<body>
<div class="container">
<header>
  <h1>Plateforme Doctorale — Université Senghor</h1>
  <div class="meta">Production Readiness Report v1.0 — 21 août 2026</div>
</header>

<h2>Résumé exécutif</h2>
<p>Le système d'information institutionnel de gestion doctorale a été conçu selon une architecture moderne (Next.js 14, Supabase, PostgreSQL) avec sécurité par défaut (Deny by Default, RLS, MFA, RBAC granulaire). Il couvre l'intégralité du parcours doctoral de la candidature à la clôture du dossier.</p>

<h2>Architecture technique</h2>
<div class="card">
  <div class="card-title">Stack</div>
  <div class="card-body">Next.js 14 App Router (Server Components + Server Actions), React, TypeScript strict, Tailwind CSS, Supabase (Auth, PostgreSQL, Storage, Edge Functions), Vercel (Hosting), Sentry (Observability).</div>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <div class="card-title">Sécurité</div>
  <div class="card-body">CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, Permissions-Policy. Rate limiting. MFA TOTP obligatoire pour les administrateurs. RLS sur 25+ tables. Service role key jamais exposée au client. Audit log append-only immuable.</div>
</div>

<h2>Base de données</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Catégorie</th><th>Tables</th><th>Contraintes clés</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Core</td><td>profiles, roles, permissions, role_permissions</td><td>FK, unique, RBAC</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Academic</td><td>academic_years, academic_programs, laboratories</td><td>1 année active max</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Candidature</td><td>candidates, applications</td><td>Business ID CAN/APP-YYYY-NNNNNN</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Doctoral</td><td>doctoral_students, enrollments, thesis, thesis_milestones</td><td>Unique (student, year), progression calculée</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Comité</td><td>committees, committee_members, meetings, reports, recommendations, actions</td><td>Unique member/committee, overdue detection</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Scientifique</td><td>trainings, training_participations, scientific_outputs</td><td>Unique (training, student)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Documents</td><td>documents, document_versions</td><td>Versionning, soft delete, checksum</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Finances</td><td>payments, payment_proofs</td><td>Business ID PAY-YYYY-NNNNNN</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Soutenance</td><td>defense_requests, juries, jury_members, defenses</td><td>Workflow 11 états, unique jury member</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Notifications</td><td>notifications, notification_preferences</td><td>Idempotence par clé</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Audit</td><td>audit_logs</td><td>Immutable (no update/delete)</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Config</td><td>system_settings, academic_calendars, job_executions</td><td>Paramètres métier configurables</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Matrice RBAC + RLS</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Rôle</th><th>Scope own</th><th>Scope assigned</th><th>Scope all</th></tr>
  <tr><td>CANDIDAT</td><td>Candidature, documents</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>
  <tr><td>DOCTORANT</td><td>Dossier, inscriptions, documents, paiements</td><td>—</td><td>—</td></tr>
  <tr><td>DIRECTEUR_DE_THESE</td><td>—</td><td>Doctorants rattachés, documents, rapports</td><td>—</td></tr>
  <tr><td>COMITE_DE_SUIVI</td><td>—</td><td>Doctorants affectés, réunions, rapports</td><td>—</td></tr>
  <tr><td>ADMINISTRATEUR</td><td colspan="3">Tout selon permissions explicites + MFA obligatoire</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Workflows implémentés</h2>
<ul class="compact">
  <li><strong>Candidature</strong> : DRAFT → SUBMITTED → UNDER_REVIEW → [CORRECTION_REQUIRED] → ACCEPTED / REJECTED / WAITLISTED → ARCHIVED</li>
  <li><strong>Inscription</strong> : DRAFT → SUBMITTED → UNDER_REVIEW → PAYMENT_PENDING → PAYMENT_VERIFICATION → APPROVED / REJECTED</li>
  <li><strong>Soutenance</strong> : DRAFT → SUBMITTED → ELIGIBILITY_CHECK → MANUSCRIPT_REVIEW → JURY_PROPOSAL → JURY_VALIDATION → SCHEDULED → HELD → RESULT_ENTERED → VALIDATED → CLOSED</li>
  <li><strong>Paiement</strong> : PENDING → SUBMITTED → UNDER_REVIEW → VERIFIED / REJECTED / CANCELLED</li>
  <li><strong>Action comité</strong> : OPEN → IN_PROGRESS → COMPLETED / OVERDUE / CANCELLED</li>
</ul>

